      "description": "1)Dutch Lady® Instant Milk Powder - Chocolate Flavoured\r\n\r\n•\tDutch Lady Instant Milk Powder (Chocolate) is a delicious and nutritious snack for you and your family to enjoy. It’s easy too. Just add water — hot or cold, and you have yourself a hearty and healthy chocolate drink. It’s great for the whole family any time of the day — morning, noon, and night.\r\n\r\n•\tJust because it has a rich chocolaty flavour doesn’t mean it compromises on nutrition, Dutch Lady Chocolate Drink is packed with the goodness of milk, Omega 3 and 5, Magnesium, and Vitamin B Complex. Only 2 servings of Dutch Lady Chocolate Drink contains 50% of your calcium requirement for the day for you to stay strong and alert all day long.\r\n\r\n2) Dutch Lady® Full Cream Milk Powder\r\n\r\n•\tWhether you’re a working hard at the office, running important errands, or training for the school’s sports day, it’s important for every member of the family to have a nutritious breakfast to be strong and succeed.\r\n\r\n•\tDutch Lady Full Cream Milk Powder contains an abundance of goodness found in milk like Protein, Calcium, and other essential nutrients for your families to stay healthy. It’s a convenient, delicious, and economical source of nutrition to nourish strong bodies throughout the day.\r\n\r\n•\tIt has a rich, creamy taste and mixes easily in hot or cold water. You can enjoy it as is, or even mixed together with your favourite coffee or tea!\r\n\r\n3) Dutch Lady® Instant Milk Powder Honey Flavoured\r\n\r\n•\tEveryone needs a sweet pick-me-up to lift our moods and keep our strength while taking on the day. Dutch Lady Instant Milk Powder, flavoured with honey provides an easy and tasty, yet nutritious solution.\r\n\r\n•\tDutch Lady Instant Milk Powder (Honey) contains all the goodness found in milk like Protein, Calcium, and other essential nutrients. It’s convenient, economical and delicious, nourishing your family with nutrients to stay strong and active throughout the day.\r\n\r\n•\tBesides being convenient, economical and delicious, Dutch Lady Instant Milk Powder (Honey) is packed with nutrients to nourish your family so they can stay strong and active throughout the day.\r\n\r\n4) Dutch Lady® Instant Milk Powder Plain\r\n\r\n•\tNo matter how busy your mornings are, it’s important for every member of the family to have a nutritious breakfast to be strong to face daily challenges. With Dutch Lady Instant Milk Powder, breakfast is so easy, delicious, and nutritious.\r\n\r\n•\tThe rich and creamy taste comes with no added sugars, so it’s healthier without compromising on taste. It mixes easily in hot or cold water, so you can have it your way. Enjoy it as is, or even mixed together with your favourite coffee or tea! \r\n\r\n•\tBesides being convenient, economical and delicious, Dutch Lady Full Cream Milk Powder is packed with nutrients to nourish your family so they can stay strong and active throughout the day.\r\n\r\n#UHT #Uhtmilk #Juicymilk #Freshmilk #Instantmilk #Chocolatemilk #Strawberrymilk\r\n#Fullcreammilk #+protein #Disneymilk #Familymilkpowder #Consumerdairy #Lowfatmilk\r\n#DutchLadymilk #DutchLadymarvel #Dutchladymilky #Dutchladyfrozen",
